<title>USA: Sportsman's Guide line of credit extended.</title>
<headline>Sportsman's Guide line of credit extended.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sportsman's Guide said Thursday that Norwest Bank extended the company's line of credit for an additional two years, through May 2000, and increased the amount available to $15 million from $5 million.</p>
<p>Norwest also reduced the interest rate under the line to the bank's prime rate, Sportsman's Guide said.</p>
<p>The catalog company sells outdoor hunting gear and surplus merchandise.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
